	"create_connected.ponder.chain_cogwheel_relay.header": "用鏈式齒輪傳遞旋轉動力",
	"create_connected.ponder.chain_cogwheel_relay.text_1": "鏈式齒輪是多了一個齒輪的鏈式傳動箱",
	"create_connected.ponder.chain_cogwheel_relay.text_2": "它們會連接同一排的其他鏈式元件",
	"create_connected.ponder.chain_cogwheel_relay.text_3": "這樣連接的所有傳動軸都會朝同一方向旋轉",
	"create_connected.ponder.chain_cogwheel_relay.text_4": "齒輪可以連接到這排任何位置的鏈式齒輪",
	"create_connected.ponder.chain_cogwheel_relay.text_5": "這排的任何部分都可以旋轉 90 度",
	"create_connected.ponder.chute.header": "用滑槽向下運送物品",
	"create_connected.ponder.chute.text_1": "滑槽可以在上下方的容器之間垂直運送物品",
	"create_connected.ponder.chute.text_2": "用扳手可以為滑槽開一扇觀景窗",
	"create_connected.ponder.chute.text_3": "用工業鋼方塊可以把滑槽包覆起來",
	"create_connected.ponder.chute.text_4": "把滑槽放在另一個滑槽的側面，就會變成斜的",
	"create_connected.ponder.chute_upward.header": "用滑槽向上運送物品",
	"create_connected.ponder.chute_upward.text_1": "在滑槽上方或下方使用鼓風機，就能讓滑槽往上運送物品",
	"create_connected.ponder.chute_upward.text_2": "戴上工程師護目鏡檢視滑槽，可以看到物品的移動方向",
	"create_connected.ponder.chute_upward.text_3": "在「被擋住」的那一端，物品必須從側面放入／取出",
	"create_connected.ponder.crank_wheel.header": "用曲柄齒輪產生旋轉動力",
	"create_connected.ponder.crank_wheel.text_1": "玩家可以用曲柄齒輪手動產生旋轉動力",
	"create_connected.ponder.crank_wheel.text_2": "按住右鍵可逆時針旋轉",
	"create_connected.ponder.crank_wheel.text_3": "潛行並按住右鍵可順時針旋轉",
	"create_connected.ponder.dashboard.header": "使用儀表板",
	"create_connected.ponder.dashboard.text_1": "儀表板是有 4 行的迷你顯示器",
	"create_connected.ponder.dashboard.text_2": "可以用寫過字的剪貼板顯示靜態文字",
	"create_connected.ponder.dashboard.text_3": "也可以透過顯示鏈路顯示動態文字",
	"create_connected.ponder.dashboard.text_4": "可以對儀表板使用染料與螢光墨囊",
	"create_connected.ponder.dashboard.text_5": "儀表板顯示的資訊會傳送到坐在它前方的玩家 HUD",
	"create_connected.ponder.dashboard.text_6": "可以用扳手停用這個功能",
	"create_connected.ponder.dashboard.text_7": "空手點擊儀表板可以重設",
	"create_connected.ponder.inventory_access_port.header": "用庫存存取埠連接庫存",
	"create_connected.ponder.inventory_access_port.text_1": "在狹小空間中存取庫存可能很麻煩",
	"create_connected.ponder.inventory_access_port.text_2": "庫存存取埠可以延伸庫存，解決這個問題",
	"create_connected.ponder.inventory_access_port.text_3": "一個庫存可以連接多個存取埠",
	"create_connected.ponder.inventory_access_port.text_4": "存取埠不提供額外的儲存空間",
	"create_connected.ponder.inventory_access_port.text_5": "但連接在存取埠上的元件可以存取庫存……",
	"create_connected.ponder.inventory_access_port.text_6": "……就像直接相連一樣",
	"create_connected.ponder.inventory_access_port.text_7": "存取埠不能串接",
	"create_connected.ponder.inventory_access_port.text_8": "但可以用紅石停用",
	"create_connected.ponder.inventory_bridge.header": "用庫存橋接器連接兩個庫存",
	"create_connected.ponder.inventory_bridge.text_1": "庫存橋接器提供同時存取兩個庫存的介面",
	"create_connected.ponder.inventory_bridge.text_2": "它不提供額外的儲存空間",
	"create_connected.ponder.inventory_bridge.text_3": "只有連接在橋接器本身的元件才能存取兩個庫存",
	"create_connected.ponder.inventory_bridge.text_4": "同一組庫存可以連接多個橋接器",
	"create_connected.ponder.inventory_bridge.text_5": "但橋接器不能串接",
	"create_connected.ponder.inventory_bridge.text_6": "用紅石訊號可以停用橋接器",
	"create_connected.ponder.inventory_bridge_filter.header": "用庫存橋接器篩選物品",
	"create_connected.ponder.inventory_bridge_filter.text_1": "庫存橋接器上的過濾欄位決定放入的物品要進入哪個庫存",
	"create_connected.ponder.inventory_bridge_filter.text_2": "兩個過濾都不符合的物品無法放入橋接器",
	"create_connected.ponder.inventory_bridge_filter.text_3": "有設定的過濾優先於空白的過濾……",
	"create_connected.ponder.inventory_bridge_filter.text_4": "……並防止符合的物品進入未過濾的一側",
	"create_connected.ponder.inventory_bridge_filter.text_5": "從庫存取出物品時會忽略過濾",
	"create_connected.ponder.inverted_clutch.header": "用反向離合器控制旋轉動力",
	"create_connected.ponder.inverted_clutch.text_1": "反向離合器不會傳遞旋轉……",
	"create_connected.ponder.inverted_clutch.text_2": "……除非有紅石訊號",
	"create_connected.ponder.inverted_gearshift.header": "用反向反轉齒輪箱控制旋轉動力",
	"create_connected.ponder.inverted_gearshift.text_1": "反向反轉齒輪箱會反轉直線傳遞的旋轉方向",
	"create_connected.ponder.inverted_gearshift.text_2": "有紅石訊號時，會以不變的方向傳遞旋轉",
	"create_connected.ponder.kinetic_battery.header": "利用動能電池儲存動能應力",
	"create_connected.ponder.kinetic_battery.text_1": "動能電池會儲存應力單位以供日後使用",
	"create_connected.ponder.kinetic_battery.text_2": "沒有紅石訊號時，它會消耗前方的動能應力來充電",
	"create_connected.ponder.kinetic_battery.text_3": "有紅石訊號時，它會以固定轉速產生固定數量的應力單位來放電",
	"create_connected.ponder.kinetic_battery.text_4": "如果動力網路的應力影響為零，電池會進入節能模式，只消耗極少量的應力單位",
	"create_connected.ponder.kinetic_battery.text_5": "可以用比較器讀取目前的電池電量",
	"create_connected.ponder.kinetic_battery.text_6": "用儲量偵測器可以得到更精確的數值",
	"create_connected.ponder.kinetic_battery_automation.header": "自動化能量傳輸",
	"create_connected.ponder.kinetic_battery_automation.text_1": "電池充滿時……",
	"create_connected.ponder.kinetic_battery_automation.text_2": "電量會以物品形式保留",
	"create_connected.ponder.kinetic_battery_automation.text_3": "電池放電時，手持已充電的電池右鍵可以充電",
	"create_connected.ponder.kinetic_battery_automation.text_4": "電池充滿時，手持空電池右鍵可以放電",
	"create_connected.ponder.kinetic_battery_automation.text_5": "機械手和機械臂可以自動進行能量傳輸",
	"create_connected.ponder.kinetic_battery_chaining.header": "串聯多個動能電池",
	"create_connected.ponder.kinetic_battery_chaining.text_1": "動能電池有一個後方輸出……",
	"create_connected.ponder.kinetic_battery_chaining.text_2": "充電／放電完成時，它會與前方輸入接合……",
	"create_connected.ponder.kinetic_battery_chaining.text_3": "但電池運作時會分離",
	"create_connected.ponder.kinetic_battery_chaining.text_4": "這樣就能串接電池，延長放電時間",
	"create_connected.ponder.kinetic_battery_chaining.text_5": "要增加總應力容量，請改為並聯電池",
	"create_connected.ponder.kinetic_bridge.header": "用動力橋接器傳遞旋轉動力",
	"create_connected.ponder.kinetic_bridge.text_1": "動力橋接器會把固定量的應力容量從一個網路轉移到另一個……",
	"create_connected.ponder.kinetic_bridge.text_11": "橋接器就無法轉移應力容量……",
	"create_connected.ponder.kinetic_bridge.text_12": "但仍會試圖消耗全部的量",
	"create_connected.ponder.kinetic_bridge.text_13": "可以在前方加一個過載離合器，釋放過載橋接器所消耗的容量",
	"create_connected.ponder.kinetic_bridge.text_2": "……同時讓兩個網路保持獨立",
	"create_connected.ponder.kinetic_bridge.text_3": "轉移的應力容量可以用數值面板調整",
	"create_connected.ponder.kinetic_bridge.text_4": "其中一個網路過載時，另一個網路不受影響",
	"create_connected.ponder.kinetic_bridge.text_5": "不過，當來源網路過載時……",
	"create_connected.ponder.linked_transmitter.header": "使用連結發訊線圈",
	"create_connected.ponder.linked_transmitter.text_1": "手持連結發訊線圈右鍵點擊紅石輸入元件，即可裝上",
	"create_connected.ponder.linked_transmitter.text_10": "用扳手右鍵點擊發訊線圈，即可從輸入元件上拆下",
	"create_connected.ponder.linked_transmitter.text_2": "連結發訊線圈可以無線傳送輸入訊號",
	"create_connected.ponder.linked_transmitter.text_3": "接收器會輸出 128 格內發訊線圈的紅石訊號",
	"create_connected.ponder.linked_transmitter.text_4": "在兩個欄位中放入物品來指定頻率",
	"create_connected.ponder.linked_transmitter.text_5": "只有頻率相符的鏈路才會互相通訊",
	"create_connected.ponder.linked_transmitter.text_6": "為了避免誤點……",
	"create_connected.ponder.linked_transmitter.text_7": "……用蜂巢右鍵點擊發訊線圈為它上蠟",
	"create_connected.ponder.linked_transmitter.text_8": "再用斧頭右鍵點擊，即可重新編輯頻率",
	"create_connected.ponder.linked_transmitter.text_9": "連結發訊線圈也能用在按鈕和類比控制桿上",
	"create_connected.ponder.parallel_gearbox.header": "用平行齒輪箱傳遞旋轉動力",
	"create_connected.ponder.parallel_gearbox.text_1": "這種配置很簡單，但目前做不到",
	"create_connected.ponder.parallel_gearbox.text_2": "平行齒輪箱把它封裝成一個方塊",
	"create_connected.ponder.parallel_gearbox.text_3": "轉角處的傳動軸以相同方向旋轉",
	"create_connected.ponder.parallel_gearbox.text_4": "直線連接的傳動軸方向會反轉",
	"create_connected.ponder.sequenced_pulse_generator.header": "用序列脈衝產生器控制訊號",
	"create_connected.ponder.sequenced_pulse_generator.text_1": "序列脈衝產生器會依照定時指令清單輸出訊號",
	"create_connected.ponder.sequenced_pulse_generator.text_2": "右鍵點擊開啟設定介面",
	"create_connected.ponder.sequenced_pulse_generator.text_3": "從背面收到訊號時……",
	"create_connected.ponder.sequenced_pulse_generator.text_4": "……它會開始執行設定好的序列",
	"create_connected.ponder.sequenced_pulse_generator.text_5": "完成後會等待下一個訊號並重新開始",
	"create_connected.ponder.sequenced_pulse_generator.text_6": "可以用紅石比較器讀取目前進度",
	"create_connected.ponder.sequenced_pulse_generator.text_7": "從側面收到訊號時……",
	"create_connected.ponder.sequenced_pulse_generator.text_8": "……它會立即重置並終止序列",
